Spec: Secure descriptor client uncertainty verification

Purpose:
  Verify capability negotiation, serialized native calls and disposal of late or untrusted native results.

Owns:
  ./SecureSessionTest.java

Must:
  Retain operation identity on uncertain attachment and dispose a result if timeout, cancellation or peer verification wins.

  Verify separate relay opt-in, rejection of unnegotiated live relay replies and recovery of historical closed relay outcomes.
